  "body": "With the local model set to AstrLink Guard (#3578), the eval case `tool-result-mixed` in internal/redact/eval_cases_test.go misses one phone:\n\n```\n$ cat contacts.csv\nname,email,phone\nRina Kobayashi,rina.k@fastmail.com,+81 90-1234-5678\nOmar Haddad,omar.haddad@proton.me,+44 7700 900123\n```\n\nThe rules don't find `+81 90-1234-5678` (a Japanese mobile), and AstrLink Guard finds the names, emails and the UK phone but not this one (testdata/eval-astrlink.json). Privacy Filter finds it.\n\nThe case carries `GuardKnown` pointing here. A fix is likely a rule for +81 mobile numbers (070/080/090), which would cover both models and rules-only users.",
  "closed_by": null,
